WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.411 --> 00:00:03.929
Unit eighteen. Understanding Pop-ups!

2
00:00:04.885 --> 00:00:09.931
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.981 --> 00:00:13.498
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.548 --> 00:00:17.892
Today we learn about Understanding Pop-ups. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.097 --> 00:00:22.846
Pop-up. Say it with me. Pop-up!

6
00:00:26.353 --> 00:00:30.172
Window. Say it with me. Window!

7
00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:37.952
Close button. Say it with me. Close button!

8
00:00:41.509 --> 00:00:44.709
Ad. Say it with me. Ad!

9
00:00:48.224 --> 00:00:52.658
Unexpected. Say it with me. Unexpected!

10
00:00:56.118 --> 00:01:00.218
X button. Say it with me. X button!

11
00:01:03.735 --> 00:01:07.535
Ignore. Say it with me. Ignore!

12
00:01:10.986 --> 00:01:15.426
Careful click. Say it with me. Careful click!

13
00:01:18.963 --> 00:01:28.158
A pop-up is a window that suddenly appears on the screen. I click the X button to close it carefully, without clicking on an ad by accident.

14
00:01:28.208 --> 00:01:31.425
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:32.153 --> 00:01:37.889
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:37.939 --> 00:01:39.386
Close button!

17
00:01:40.298 --> 00:01:45.841
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:45.891 --> 00:01:47.041
Ignore!

19
00:01:48.118 --> 00:01:55.316
Did you know? Some pop-ups are ads, and clicking them by accident can sometimes take you to an unwanted website!

20
00:01:55.366 --> 00:01:57.550
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:58.614 --> 00:02:09.081
Think and answer. What should you do if a pop-up appears while you're using a device?

22
00:02:09.131 --> 00:02:10.343
Great answer!

23
00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:16.920
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:20.037
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

